WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:02.500
Two windows on 204 The Ferry: Dana Reyes on the left and Sam Okafor on the right. Both read Saved · Synced.

00:02.500 --> 00:10.800
Dana writes a line of action and a speech for CALLUM. Every letter appears live in Sam's window beside Dana's named caret.

00:10.800 --> 00:15.500
Dana selects a phrase and leaves a comment for Sam. The highlight and comment badge appear immediately in both windows.

00:15.500 --> 00:26.000
Sam's network is cut. He keeps writing on his own device, and his status reads Saved · Offline, 3 waiting. Dana does not have those lines yet.

00:26.000 --> 00:32.000
Sam's network comes back. His status returns to Saved · Synced, and Dana's window holds every line he wrote offline.

00:32.000 --> 00:38.500
On The Long Night, locked pages keep Blue revision marks on the margin while Ghost Follow tracks the scene on screen with a Back to Sc. 1 link.

00:38.500 --> 00:45.000
On Lannick One News, the rundown tracks Air, Target and Under times live, holding edits inside the air window until Send to prompter is chosen.
